<title>USA: Famous Footwear Dec same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Famous Footwear Dec same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$76.4	  n/a	+5.3	 +0.9</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $724.2	  n/a	+8.8	 +1.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	5 weeks ended	   Jan 4.</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures above are for Famous Footwear division of Brown Group Inc. December sales for Naturalizer division were $13.0 million, down 12.8 pct on a net basis, and down 12.3 pct on a same-store basis.</p>
<p>Year-to-date sales for the Naturalizer division were $122.5 million, down 1.7 pct net, and down 0.7 pct same-store.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
